WEBVTT

00:14.990 --> 00:16.570
Lord Granbarza...

00:22.010 --> 00:23.040
Why have you come here?

00:26.090 --> 00:27.290
Alantsil...

00:34.190 --> 00:35.550
Wait, please!

00:36.030 --> 00:37.910
Out of the way, Dariel.

00:38.540 --> 00:39.060
Right now,

00:39.680 --> 00:42.810
after hearing that I'm your son,
 I'm feeling confused.

00:44.770 --> 00:48.710
Lord Granbarza is the one who 
raised me. I owe him so very much.

00:48.710 --> 00:51.070
Please, won't you allow him to speak?

00:55.680 --> 00:57.410
So, you've already heard?

00:59.040 --> 01:01.340
I only learned of it a short while ago.

01:02.740 --> 01:06.080
Though I had realized that you are human.

01:07.370 --> 01:10.840
When you turned five and couldn't 
use magic, it worried me.

01:11.240 --> 01:15.590
As I researched, I began to think 
that perhaps you were human.

01:16.960 --> 01:18.860
I've agonized over it for all this time.

01:20.380 --> 01:23.200
But I couldn't let you go.

01:24.680 --> 01:25.960
I'm sorry.

01:27.200 --> 01:28.960
<i>He's been suffering this whole time...</i>

01:31.000 --> 01:32.490
Lord Granbarza...

01:34.080 --> 01:36.300
you didn't just raise me.

01:36.980 --> 01:40.200
Ever since I can remember, 
you were there beside me.

01:41.040 --> 01:44.390
My work as an aide gave me such 
a sense of accomplishment!

01:44.920 --> 01:46.640
Even though the parents who 
bore me weren't with me,

01:46.640 --> 01:49.170
I never felt the slightest bit unfortunate!

01:49.690 --> 01:52.550
All of that... is thanks to you!

01:53.630 --> 01:56.060
Even a lifetime wouldn't be enough 
to repay my gratitude to you.

01:56.060 --> 01:56.910
No.

01:59.000 --> 02:01.140
I am the one who has received so much.

02:01.870 --> 02:04.520
You have given me something 
which is irreplaceable.

02:06.160 --> 02:08.350
The reason I was able to become stronger...

02:08.350 --> 02:11.560
is that I was able to spend time with you.

02:12.570 --> 02:15.820
It was because I wanted to remain 
a person you respected...

02:16.150 --> 02:19.090
that I was able to become the person 
others called "the strongest."

02:22.780 --> 02:23.740
You...

02:24.180 --> 02:25.830
are the pride of my life...

02:26.840 --> 02:28.580
my treasure.

02:42.020 --> 02:44.050
That time...

02:44.050 --> 02:45.850
was supposed to be mine.

02:46.710 --> 02:48.600
Spending time with my son...

02:48.600 --> 02:51.910
having that time turn into strength... 
That was supposed to be me.

02:51.910 --> 02:53.650
But Granbarza...

02:54.060 --> 02:56.150
You stole that from me!

02:57.020 --> 02:59.570
It was hate that made me stronger.

02:59.570 --> 03:02.820
Hate and rage are what made me this strong.

03:03.430 --> 03:05.370
Even if my son is still alive...

03:06.180 --> 03:11.730
the time we were supposed to have 
spent together will never return.

03:12.700 --> 03:16.250
While I still carry this hatred...

03:16.470 --> 03:18.520
How am I supposed to live?

03:19.230 --> 03:20.540
Mister Alantsil...

03:21.460 --> 03:23.220
There is no need to carry it.

03:24.040 --> 03:25.720
Send it my way instead.

03:27.360 --> 03:30.980
What Bezetan did was utterly despicable.

03:31.900 --> 03:35.820
I must accept responsibility 
for my associate's crimes.

03:37.880 --> 03:38.740
Dariel...

03:39.450 --> 03:43.700
I had thought to take you back 
to the Demon King's Army...

03:44.160 --> 03:46.170
but it isn't too late.

03:46.170 --> 03:47.700
You and your real father...

03:48.800 --> 03:50.170
can still be happy.

04:06.760 --> 04:11.100
<b>Chillin'</b>

04:06.760 --> 04:11.100
<b>in My 30s after Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</b>

05:22.000 --> 05:25.010
<b>Episode 10</b>

05:22.000 --> 05:25.010
<b>Dariel, Showered in Sparks.</b>

05:27.760 --> 05:30.010
Perhaps my journey of revenge...

05:30.440 --> 05:33.810
was always supposed to 
come to an end this way.

05:39.920 --> 05:41.070
<i>I have to stop this.</i>

05:41.520 --> 05:45.730
<i>But... I know that wouldn't be right when
Lord Granbarza wants to atone.</i>

05:45.730 --> 05:50.070
<i>And I have no right to stop 
Mister Alantsil from taking revenge.</i>

05:51.010 --> 05:52.120
<i>What should I do?</i>

06:05.440 --> 06:06.920
M-Malika!

06:08.220 --> 06:10.800
Right. Please leave it at that.

06:11.180 --> 06:14.320
I don't know your circumstances,

06:14.320 --> 06:17.810
but the ugliness of fighting 
out of hatred...

06:18.220 --> 06:20.310
Please don't show that to your grandson!

06:20.580 --> 06:23.570
G-Grandson?

06:23.570 --> 06:26.190
This is Dariel's and my son.

06:26.450 --> 06:27.580
Which means...

06:27.580 --> 06:29.500
both of you gentlemen are his grandpas!

06:30.600 --> 06:32.410
G-Grandpa?!

06:32.410 --> 06:33.970
That's right!

06:33.970 --> 06:36.960
<i>Th-The two greatest heroes in history...</i>

06:36.960 --> 06:38.660
<i>and she's calling them both "grandpa"!</i>

06:40.210 --> 06:44.040
<i>But... thanks to her, 
I know what I should do now.</i>

06:45.760 --> 06:47.100
Lord Granbarza...

06:47.910 --> 06:50.200
If you wish for my happiness,

06:50.800 --> 06:52.800
then, no matter what happens, please live.

06:55.300 --> 06:56.310
Mister Alantsil...

06:57.260 --> 07:00.640
Your time as a parent may not return,

07:01.260 --> 07:03.260
but if you would be a grandfather...

07:04.570 --> 07:08.340
Would you spend some 
time with that child?

07:18.080 --> 07:19.160
What is his name?

07:19.160 --> 07:20.710
His name is Gran.

07:21.760 --> 07:24.960
I see. Your name's Gran, huh?

07:25.910 --> 07:27.980
He's adorable.

07:27.980 --> 07:29.500
Master Alantsil...

07:31.700 --> 07:33.780
Malika, thank you.

07:33.780 --> 07:35.220
For what?

07:35.690 --> 07:38.220
I'm glad it was you that I married.

07:40.090 --> 07:40.980
What?!

07:41.360 --> 07:44.380
Oh! How embarrassing!

07:57.210 --> 07:57.740
Huh?

07:58.340 --> 08:00.840
What's going on here?

08:00.840 --> 08:02.040
It's time, isn't it?

08:03.210 --> 08:04.300
You there!

08:04.300 --> 08:07.770
Today is the advance party for my becoming 
the greatest of the Four Generals.

08:07.770 --> 08:09.290
Is everyone late?

08:09.900 --> 08:11.420
No.

08:11.420 --> 08:13.550
It isn't that they're late, 
they aren't attending.

08:14.540 --> 08:17.800
Everyone has declined your invitation.

08:18.430 --> 08:19.090
What?

08:19.620 --> 08:21.310
Lord Bashbarza...

08:21.590 --> 08:24.430
Lord Granbarza has gone to the Demon King...

08:24.430 --> 08:27.310
and petitioned for your dismissal.

08:28.720 --> 08:30.950
Father did that? Why?

08:30.950 --> 08:34.570
Because of you, 
the Demon King's Army is falling apart.

08:35.350 --> 08:37.450
It isn't just the Mythril Mine.

08:37.930 --> 08:41.180
Everyone from the citizens to the 
demi-humans has lost faith in us.

08:41.790 --> 08:44.790
Do you know how difficult it 
will be to regain that trust?

08:46.230 --> 08:47.200
But that's why!

08:47.200 --> 08:50.840
I've finally found and perfected a secret 
stratagem for defeating the Hero!

08:50.840 --> 08:52.340
It's too late!

08:53.120 --> 08:55.570
Can't you tell by looking at 
this event hall?

08:55.570 --> 08:58.560
Grapes! Grapes! Grapes!

08:58.560 --> 09:02.730
Th-Then what should I have done?

09:02.730 --> 09:04.430
Well...

09:04.430 --> 09:07.150
If the aide, Dariel, had been here...

09:07.150 --> 09:08.910
things may have been different.

09:09.640 --> 09:10.890
If you'll excuse me.

09:15.200 --> 09:16.220
Blast it!

09:19.120 --> 09:21.120
Alcohol! Bring me alcohol!

09:22.870 --> 09:24.080
That won't be possible.

09:24.080 --> 09:24.910
What?!

09:25.520 --> 09:29.430
Well, you haven't been paying
your invoices lately...

09:29.930 --> 09:33.400
And... if now it's possible that you 
might leave the Four Generals...

09:33.400 --> 09:34.300
Never!

09:34.830 --> 09:37.000
I would never quit the Four Generals!

09:37.000 --> 09:39.180
And up until now, I've been 
able to put things on a tab!

09:39.180 --> 09:42.290
Previously, Mister Dariel was here, so...

09:43.320 --> 09:48.300
We could trust Mister Dariel to ensure
that all the bills were paid on time...

09:49.110 --> 09:52.470
But now that he's gone, we have to be more careful...

09:50.550 --> 09:51.600
<i>Dariel...</i>

09:52.470 --> 09:53.510
<i>Dariel...</i>

09:54.360 --> 09:55.480
<i>Dariel...</i>

09:56.820 --> 09:59.690
<i>Dariel. Dariel. Dariel...</i>

09:59.690 --> 10:02.500
<i>Dariel. Dariel. Dariel!</i>

10:12.380 --> 10:15.170
Every single one of them is an idiot.

10:15.520 --> 10:17.420
Insulting me...

10:20.430 --> 10:23.060
I'll make all of them regret it.

10:23.060 --> 10:24.680
Touch it and you'll get burned!

10:25.300 --> 10:27.340
But he alone...

10:30.040 --> 10:33.190
He who insulted me more than anyone...

10:35.130 --> 10:37.550
Exile was too good for him.

10:38.660 --> 10:39.820
Dariel!

10:40.800 --> 10:43.630
That filthy incompetent...

10:44.580 --> 10:47.080
I will burn him so completely 
that not even ash remains!

10:47.080 --> 10:50.080
<b>Chillin'
 in My 30s after Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</b>

10:52.750 --> 10:55.750
Oh, there, there!

10:55.990 --> 10:58.630
It's your grandpa!

10:59.630 --> 11:02.790
Just look at these manly eyebrows!

11:02.790 --> 11:05.330
He's going to be a brawny future Hero!

11:05.330 --> 11:06.510
No, no.

11:06.510 --> 11:09.120
What about those piercing eyes?

11:09.120 --> 11:10.850
He's overflowing with intelligence.

11:10.850 --> 11:14.150
It reminds me of when Dariel was very young.

11:14.500 --> 11:19.070
<i>The feared Lord Granbarza and Mister Alantsil...</i>

11:16.500 --> 11:18.160
Oh, how adorable!

11:19.070 --> 11:20.900
<i>make very good grandpas.</i>

11:19.070 --> 11:20.900
He's so pudgy!

11:20.900 --> 11:21.680
Mm-hmm!

11:21.680 --> 11:26.100
H-Hey! You're being too familiar 
with my grandson, Granbarza!

11:27.010 --> 11:29.990
Don't call my name around little Gran.

11:29.990 --> 11:33.280
He'll think you're talking 
about him, you know?

11:33.280 --> 11:33.830
What?

11:34.110 --> 11:37.350
Oh, but what a good name it is!

11:37.350 --> 11:41.510
Where could it come from? 
What do you think, Alantsil?

11:42.070 --> 11:43.560
His name...

11:42.260 --> 11:49.470
<b>Granbarza</b>

11:43.260 --> 11:49.470
<b>Bashbarza</b>

11:43.560 --> 11:45.730
Should we change it to Alanbarza?

11:44.260 --> 11:49.470
<b>Alanbarza</b>

11:46.260 --> 11:49.470
<i>Wouldn't that put him in 
Lord Granbarza's lineage?</i>

11:51.260 --> 11:53.160
What's wrong, Gran?

11:53.160 --> 11:56.150
You feel dirty? Is it that bearded old man?

11:56.150 --> 11:59.280
Here, look! I'll give you a toy!

12:01.110 --> 12:03.380
You don't know my grandson's mind at all!

12:03.380 --> 12:04.890
It's his diaper!

12:04.890 --> 12:06.490
There, there, Gran.

12:07.120 --> 12:09.220
Let's change your diaper, shall we?

12:07.120 --> 12:09.220
No, no!

12:10.230 --> 12:13.120
Hey, Rizet. Things are crazy right now.

12:13.380 --> 12:15.240
Eyez? Eyez?

12:15.240 --> 12:17.690
<i>Oh, Gran is calling for you. I'll put him on.</i>

12:18.650 --> 12:22.760
<i>Gran? It's Rizet! My name isn't "Eyes," okay?</i>

12:22.760 --> 12:24.030
Rizet?

12:24.030 --> 12:25.930
Who is Rizet?

12:25.930 --> 12:28.950
Eyez! B-Beerd!

12:28.950 --> 12:31.660
<i>Wh-What did you say? You're 
being attacked by bearded men?!</i>

12:31.660 --> 12:33.020
<i>Put them on, Gran!</i>

12:33.020 --> 12:33.940
Uh...

12:34.700 --> 12:35.880
Hello.

12:35.880 --> 12:37.690
<i>And who are you?</i>

12:38.070 --> 12:39.670
You give your name first.

12:39.670 --> 12:42.730
<i>I-I am the special envoy, Rizet!</i>

12:42.730 --> 12:46.640
<i>You just try laying a single finger 
on Gran! You'll have me to deal with!</i>

12:46.640 --> 12:47.950
Is that so?

12:48.170 --> 12:50.850
I am Granbarza of the Hellfire.

12:50.850 --> 12:51.440
What?

12:51.440 --> 12:56.210
With no regard to me, you seem 
very close with my grandson.

12:56.210 --> 12:59.180
I might burn you to a 
crisp in spite of myself.

12:59.180 --> 13:02.070
Let's discuss this thoroughly 
upon my return,

13:00.110 --> 13:02.070
<i>I-I...</i>

13:02.070 --> 13:05.300
Mister Special Envoy Rizet.

13:03.780 --> 13:05.300
<i>Um, Lord Granbar—</i>

13:06.900 --> 13:07.850
<i>Rizet...</i>

13:08.500 --> 13:09.550
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

13:10.720 --> 13:12.520
Dinner is ready!

13:12.520 --> 13:14.430
Missus, this all looks delicious!

13:13.840 --> 13:15.730
U-Um...

13:14.430 --> 13:15.730
Yes, it really does.

13:16.400 --> 13:19.670
I feel like I'm sitting in the wrong place.

13:19.670 --> 13:21.940
Father, have some alcohol.

13:22.680 --> 13:26.030
<i>Oh. Since they're all my fathers, 
it's hard to call out to any one of them.</i>

13:26.490 --> 13:28.430
Mister Envil, allow me.

13:28.430 --> 13:30.530
Oh, um... T-Thank you.

13:30.530 --> 13:33.110
Mister Envil, are you on the strong side?

13:33.110 --> 13:35.790
Me? Oh, not at all.

13:35.790 --> 13:36.310
<i>Huh?</i>

13:36.690 --> 13:39.580
<i>Father's name is Envil!</i>

13:40.010 --> 13:42.040
Cheers!

13:42.040 --> 13:44.460
Ch-Cheers...

13:51.470 --> 13:53.230
Now, that's some good booze!

13:53.230 --> 13:54.310
Another round!

14:00.230 --> 14:01.150
<i>What?</i>

14:01.150 --> 14:02.830
<i>They're already drunk?!</i>

14:10.640 --> 14:11.810
It was...

14:11.810 --> 14:15.290
when Dariel was about 
five years old, I think.

14:15.900 --> 14:18.280
His magic lessons weren't going well,

14:18.280 --> 14:20.460
but even though he cried, 
he just kept working at it.

14:21.040 --> 14:25.430
I nearly told him, "You don't have to 
try anymore," so many times, but...

14:25.430 --> 14:29.930
I wish I had those kinds 
of memories, too! Blast it!

14:31.010 --> 14:31.720
No.

14:32.130 --> 14:33.300
It's fine.

14:36.110 --> 14:39.870
After crossing swords with Dariel 
and talking with him, I understand.

14:40.720 --> 14:44.980
He was raised by a wonderful father.

14:47.980 --> 14:49.240
Granbarza...

14:49.780 --> 14:53.590
thank you for raising my son into a fine man.

15:12.800 --> 15:15.050
Here. This should be everything.

15:15.050 --> 15:17.400
I don't mind doing all the clean up.

15:17.400 --> 15:19.310
No, I can do this much.

15:19.800 --> 15:20.560
Ow!

15:20.560 --> 15:22.000
Honestly.

15:22.000 --> 15:23.810
You're trying to keep going through the pain.

15:24.400 --> 15:27.380
Let's reapply the medicine, all right?

15:31.830 --> 15:35.140
I'm sorry about today. 
I caused you a lot of worry.

15:35.140 --> 15:36.330
Yes, you did!

15:36.910 --> 15:41.180
If Mister Alantsil hadn't been your father,
 I would have punched him!

15:42.580 --> 15:46.120
And you, too. You're always so reckless.

15:47.680 --> 15:48.340
But...

15:49.190 --> 15:50.850
you worked hard today.

15:52.560 --> 15:55.210
That kindness of yours...

15:55.830 --> 15:56.890
I love it.

15:57.210 --> 15:58.300
Malika...

15:59.050 --> 16:02.020
I'll go take care of the clean up now.

16:02.530 --> 16:05.240
Oh! That special dessert 
I've left next to you...

16:05.240 --> 16:07.450
Please eat it before you take your medicine.

16:18.400 --> 16:18.790
Oh!

16:23.220 --> 16:23.790
Huh?

16:25.530 --> 16:27.210
Lady Zebiantes?

16:27.210 --> 16:29.180
You're like an old man.

16:30.480 --> 16:32.450
How are you holding up?

16:32.450 --> 16:36.080
Fine. Malika's medicine is working very well.

16:36.080 --> 16:37.300
Really.

16:37.770 --> 16:39.810
<i>What about you, Lady Zebiantes?</i>

16:40.160 --> 16:43.060
<i>You went through so many 
scary experiences today.</i>

16:43.060 --> 16:44.350
<i>Are you all right?</i>

16:44.350 --> 16:47.360
Still... I was quite shocked, you know?

16:47.360 --> 16:48.060
Huh?

16:48.060 --> 16:52.210
To think that you love me.

16:52.210 --> 16:52.820
Wha?!

16:53.730 --> 16:57.510
You suddenly said all those 
things in front of everyone!

16:57.510 --> 16:58.660
"All those things"?

16:59.060 --> 16:59.970
And, for me...

17:00.400 --> 17:03.660
Lady Zebiantes, trembling behind 
me right now, is also precious.

17:04.200 --> 17:06.390
If I lost Lady Zebiantes...

17:06.390 --> 17:07.690
it would be just as painful.

17:10.030 --> 17:13.220
To say that I'm just as important 
to you as the missus...

17:13.220 --> 17:14.920
That was just an example of—

17:14.920 --> 17:16.310
As for my reply...

17:16.310 --> 17:19.800
Well, I suppose I'll think about it.

17:19.800 --> 17:21.300
No, wait!

17:24.420 --> 17:26.100
He's so flustered!

17:26.570 --> 17:29.110
That guy is <i>so</i> worth teasing!

17:37.680 --> 17:38.740
Master Alantsil...

17:38.740 --> 17:40.990
I hope you'll train me again today.

17:42.400 --> 17:43.200
So...

17:43.590 --> 17:45.310
you'll still fight after all?

17:46.210 --> 17:49.280
The sorrow of those close to Miss Laidy...

17:49.280 --> 17:51.090
Everything that happened 
to Mister Alantsil...

17:51.650 --> 17:54.030
You've held all that inside yourselves.

17:54.960 --> 18:00.020
Miss Laidy, you must understand 
now that not all demons are bad.

18:00.020 --> 18:02.400
Will you still fight against them?

18:02.400 --> 18:03.770
Of course.

18:03.770 --> 18:06.680
Defeating the Demon King is the Hero's duty.

18:06.920 --> 18:11.030
What is the Demon King to the Hero?

18:11.030 --> 18:12.860
The Demon King?

18:13.730 --> 18:17.820
The Demon King is the source of 
all the misfortune in the world.

18:18.300 --> 18:20.590
And so, if we defeat the Demon King...

18:20.590 --> 18:22.580
an age of peace and abundance will begin.

18:23.890 --> 18:27.530
All the Heroes of history have 
believed that as they fought.

18:28.880 --> 18:30.840
That seems a little too convenient, doesn't it?

18:30.840 --> 18:31.670
Yes.

18:32.690 --> 18:35.170
But that's just the official story.

18:37.280 --> 18:42.140
The Demon King possesses the greatest 
wisdom and power in this world.

18:43.780 --> 18:46.990
If we defeat him, we can steal it all.

18:46.990 --> 18:49.500
That's what Center Guild thinks.

18:49.980 --> 18:54.720
It's all so that humanity can 
evolve into an even greater race.

18:54.720 --> 18:56.610
And what are they basing this on?

18:56.890 --> 19:01.910
For example, they say that magic is something 
that the Demon King once bestowed upon the demons.

19:02.930 --> 19:04.530
If we defeat the Demon King,

19:04.530 --> 19:07.600
then we would at the very least 
come into possession of magic.

19:07.600 --> 19:10.040
I'm sure that's what 
Center Guild is thinking.

19:10.690 --> 19:12.460
What is the truth of it?

19:13.630 --> 19:19.010
There is a legend that the Demon King 
bestowed it upon us long ago, but...

19:19.680 --> 19:22.610
It's awkward to think of 
asking the king himself.

19:23.070 --> 19:25.460
That's a strange way of talking about it.

19:25.460 --> 19:28.800
You're speaking as if the legendary 
Demon King is still alive.

19:28.800 --> 19:29.730
Oh. He is.

19:30.430 --> 19:32.850
The Demon King is still the first Demon King.

19:32.850 --> 19:33.730
What?

19:33.730 --> 19:37.180
Since the moment I took up my post,
 there has been no change.

19:37.180 --> 19:39.790
It's very possible that 
he's unaging and immortal.

19:41.210 --> 19:44.450
To think that he transcends 
other beings so greatly.

19:45.920 --> 19:48.910
You are free to give up on challenging him.

19:49.940 --> 19:52.860
The battle is steeped in human greed.

19:53.390 --> 19:56.670
Now that you've heard, you can't 
stand it anymore, can you?

19:59.600 --> 20:04.030
Even if I were to quit, the battle 
would continue, wouldn't it?

20:04.030 --> 20:05.180
I'm sure it would.

20:05.590 --> 20:08.130
That being the case, I will continue.

20:09.840 --> 20:12.160
Once I have seen everything 
with my own eyes...

20:12.160 --> 20:14.350
I will find my own answer.

20:14.880 --> 20:15.880
I see.

20:17.450 --> 20:20.410
If that's what you've 
decided, then very well.

20:20.410 --> 20:20.860
Yes, sir!

20:21.580 --> 20:23.360
<i>Her own answer, huh?</i>

20:24.170 --> 20:25.660
<i>Yes, that's right.</i>

20:25.660 --> 20:28.130
<i>Finding the answer yourself is important!</i>

20:29.760 --> 20:31.550
Big Bro! Things are bad!

20:31.550 --> 20:32.880
What could it be?

20:32.880 --> 20:33.830
I'll go.

20:35.610 --> 20:37.030
Mister Fittbitan?

20:37.030 --> 20:38.190
What's happened?

20:38.190 --> 20:39.460
The Mythril Mine...

20:40.140 --> 20:42.300
is under attack by a monster!

20:42.600 --> 20:43.620
What?

20:43.620 --> 20:45.890
Please, we need reinforcements immediately!

20:46.310 --> 20:50.460
Gashita, assemble a squad 
and follow after us.

20:50.460 --> 20:51.600
Yes, sir!

20:52.880 --> 20:55.600
Lady Zebiantes, may I ask you to transport us?

20:55.990 --> 20:57.560
Zebi, please!

20:57.560 --> 21:00.610
Not a problem. It's a simple enough task.

21:05.290 --> 21:07.120
Then let's head out.

21:16.080 --> 21:17.900
We're almost there!

21:21.670 --> 21:22.300
What is that?

21:23.420 --> 21:24.990
It's so hot!

21:29.360 --> 21:33.100
Th-That monster... I've never 
seen one like that before.

21:36.590 --> 21:37.600
We must land.

21:38.110 --> 21:41.360
Approaching any closer in 
this manner is dangerous.

21:47.320 --> 21:48.310
Casualties?

21:48.310 --> 21:50.820
We're all fine! But...

21:50.820 --> 21:53.200
The Knockers are all still inside!

21:53.700 --> 21:54.660
Everyone...

21:55.100 --> 21:56.920
I'm going to go check on the Knockers!

21:56.920 --> 21:58.040
Dariel!

21:59.790 --> 22:03.800
Well, then. We should try 
to contain that monster.

22:07.440 --> 22:08.550
<i>Please...</i>

22:08.820 --> 22:09.970
<i>Please be all right!</i>

23:41.670 --> 23:46.320
Next time on <i>Chillin' in My 30s after 
Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</i>,

23:46.320 --> 23:48.650
"Dariel Has a Showdown."

23:48.650 --> 23:51.070
<b>Episode 11</b>

23:48.650 --> 23:51.070
<b>Dariel Has a Showdown.</b>
